<title>USA: Price underwriters exercise overallotment.</title>
<headline>Price underwriters exercise overallotment.</headline>
<dateline>SAN DIEGO 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Price REIT Inc said Friday underwriters of its recent public stock offering, Merrill Lynch &amp; Co and Sutro &amp; Co Inc, have exercised their option to purchase 90,000 common shares at a price of $32.125 a share.</p>
</text>
